      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "王录业",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "大方相，论除妖驱傩，在下于您无异于萤光之于皓月。这些事情，在下自然要找专事之人，您说是不是。",
      "next": "r0156",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0156",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "……",
      "next": "r0157",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0157",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "王录业",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "您手中这锁魔镜，是为裁断春秋之物，可收押放逐一切妖魂灵鬼。您在妖界的身份，仍然是一个令人敬畏的大方相。",
      "next": "r0158",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0158",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "王录业",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "在下手中这面镜，是为沟通两界之桥梁，与其他镜简单的照见不同。通过此镜，在下可将您神魂一缕投至妖界，方便暗中调查行动，不知崔方相意向如何？",
      "next": "r0160",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0160",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "王录业",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "崔方相不妨随我同行。",
      "next": "r0162",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
